## 8. Gotchas

| # | Problem | Symptom | Fix |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `run_id` used as a metric attribute | Mimir OOM; backend bill spikes | Spans only; enforce via Collector `attributes` processor (§5.2) |
| 2 | OTLP name ≠ PromQL name | Dashboards return no data | Dots→underscores, unit suffix, `_total` on counters (§5.3) |
| 3 | Run pods have no OTel env | Daemon traced, runs completely dark | Run pods don't inherit chart env — set `k8sRunLauncher.envVars` (§6) |
| 4 | Operator injection misses run pods | Annotation set, nothing injected | Run pods are runtime-created — annotate via `runK8sConfig.podTemplateSpecMetadata` |
| 5 | Short-lived step pods drop telemetry | Randomly missing spans/metrics | `force_flush()` before returning; `OTEL_BSP_SCHEDULE_DELAY=1000`; `terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 30` |
| 6 | Multiprocess executor forks | Only the first op reports | Call the `lru_cache`d `init_otel()` inside each op, not at module import |
| 7 | SQLAlchemy spans flood everything | 5000+ spans per run | `OTEL_PYTHON_DISABLED_INSTRUMENTATIONS=sqlalchemy,psycopg2` |
| 8 | Daemon-death alert depends on the daemon | Alert silently never fires | `absent_over_time` plus a Source A pod-liveness cross-check (§5.5) |
| 9 | `run_status_sensor` misses events | Undercounting after restarts | Expected — alert from Source A, analyse from Source B |
| 10 | `dagster/` tag prefix rejected | Tag write fails or is dropped | Reserved namespace — use `otel/traceparent` |
| 11 | `inject_into_tags()` returns `{}` | Traces never link up | Generator suspension — call inside the span before yielding, reuse the result |
| 12 | Half-sampled traces | Trace exists but branches missing | Daemon `always_on`, downstream `parentbased_traceidratio` |
| 13 | OTLP port confusion | Silent data loss | gRPC = 4317 (bare endpoint); HTTP = 4318 (SDK appends `/v1/metrics`) |
| 14 | `context.run.tags` absent on asset checks | AttributeError | Asset-check contexts differ — guard with `hasattr` |

